__pycache__/
*.pyc
.coverage
*.log
.claude/

# Generated font-variant training crops — 6,000 files, regenerated in ~1 min by
# `python _gen_font_variants.py --n 6000`. The MANIFEST is tracked, the pixels are not:
# the hand-labeled crops in pending/ are irreplaceable and stay tracked, these are not.
training_data_crnn/fontvar_*

# 625 MB archive nothing in the tree references. Kept on disk, never in history —
# once a blob that size is committed it cannot be removed without rewriting every hash.
ocr.zip

# NOTE: *.bak_* is deliberately NOT ignored. This repo COMMITS its backups as an
# archival convention -- 7 are tracked (predotfix, preoverride, polluted, presigtree).
# An ignore rule here would silently hide the next deliberate one.
